                <h1 class="content-title">Developer <span class="gradient-text">Patterns & APIs</span></h1>
                <p class="content-subtitle">
                    Practical developer guidance for extending and integrating with Hardware Asset Management — Business Rules, Flow Designer, REST APIs, and common customization patterns.
                </p>
